blocks.en:
Figure 2: Results for synthetic data.
(a) Maximum projection of the image sequence;
(b) ground-truth blinking-cell supports, excluding static distractors;
extracted supports from (c) Suite2p [ 2 ] ,
(d) CaImAn [ 6 ] , and (e) PM-Adaptive;
and (f) spatial visualization of the PM-Adaptive embedding.
In (b)–(e), different colors denote distinct source supports;
in (f), the three latent coordinates are mapped to RGB for visualization.

blocks.zh:
图2:合成数据的结果。
(a) 图像序列的最大投影;
(b) 地面实况闪烁细胞支持,但不包括静态转移器;
从 (c) Suite2p [2] 提取支持,
(d) CaimAn [6]和(e) PM-Adaptive;
(f) PM-Adaptive嵌入的空间可视化。
在(b)-(e)中,不同的颜色表示不同的源支持;
在(f)中,三个潜在坐标被映射到RGB,用于可视化。
